# A relative and an ssh URL resolve to addresses; an empty URL prints `?`.
args: ls example.com/handwritten/submods@abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01
exit: 0
--- stdout
example.com/handwritten/submods@abcdef012345  5 entries  1 dir  1 file  3 submodules
file       README.md
submodule  empty  ?
submodule  rel  example.com/handwritten/shared-lib@222222222222
dir        src/
submodule  ssh  example.com/handwritten/ssh-lib@333333333333
